      "writtenOn": "2017-11-27T21:30:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When chip is shutdowned by reset pin, some registers must be initialized whenever duty is changed form 0 to non-zero value. So we want to set reset pin to high during S0.\nThank you.",
