      "writtenOn": "2017-11-29T15:35:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, but doing 5 I2C accesses instead of 3 when going from PWM \u003d\u003d 0 to PWM !\u003d 0 doesn\u0027t seem a big roadblock ?",
